  "question": {
    "text": "If the equation of a plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>, passing through the intersection of the planes,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math> for some&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the distance of the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> from the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of plane of passing through intersection of planes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ......<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; .....<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;.......<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;........<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>On comparing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>42</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>48</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>75</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;So, equation of plane is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;......<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Distance of plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>21</mn><msqrt><mn>49</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
